            "repere": "Paragraphe · As a cat parent with an old and arthri…",
            "text": "As a cat parent with an old and arthritic cat, I made the switch to Catalyst Pet a while ago. As a veterinarian, I recommend owners of older cats use a softer litter — Toby has really enjoyed the softness of Catalyst on his old toe beans. As a human, I also enjoy its great odor control, and love that when our cats leave the box they don't track hard bits of litter all over.",
