            "slot": "s2145",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I've tried several cat litters over th…",
            "text": "I've tried several cat litters over the years, but Catalyst has been a game-changer for me and my cats. It's made from sustainable materials, so I feel good about using it, and it controls odors incredibly well. The clumping is strong and easy to scoop, making cleanup a breeze. Plus, it's lightweight and dust-free, which means less mess and healthier air for both my cats and me. Catalyst is the perfect blend of eco-friendly and cat-friendly, and that’s hard to do!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
