            "slot": "s2174",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Catalyst Pet keeps my home fresh and m…",
            "text": "Catalyst Pet keeps my home fresh and my cats happy—an absolute game-changer! I love how the litter not only controls odors but is also eco-friendly. My cats adapted to it quickly, and it’s made cleaning a breeze! Using Catalyst cat litter has completely transformed our litter routine. It controls odors remarkably well, and its sustainable materials make me feel good about my choice. The transition was seamless for all of my cats, and I love that it’s so easy to clean. It’s a small and healthy change that makes a big difference for both my pets and the planet!",
